"font-size:18px; line-height:1.4; color:#0b3b68; font-weight:700;\">{{$json[\"data\"][0][\"action_recommandee\"]}}</div>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; margin:0 0 22px;\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"width:50%; background:#f7fafc; border:1px solid #d9e2ec; border-radius:8px 0 0 8px; padding:18px; text-align:center;\">\n                      <div style=\"font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:#667085; font-weight:700;\">Probabilite de fidelite</div>\n                      <div style=\"margin-top:8px; font-size:28px; line-height:1.1; color:#182230; font-weight:700;\">{{ ($json[\"data\"][0][\"probabilite_fidelite\"] * 100).toFixed(1) }}%</div>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"width:50%; background:#f7fafc; border:1px solid #d9e2ec; border-left:none; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0; padding:18px; text-align:center;\">\n                      <div style=\"font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:#667085; font-weight:700;\">Statut</div>\n                      <div style=\"margin-top:8px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.2; color:#182230;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; background:#fef3f2; color:#b42318; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:999px;\">Action requise</span></div>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#344054;\">Nous vous invitons a profiter de nos nouvelles offres personnalisees concues specialement pour ameliorer votre experience evenementielle.</p>\n                <div style=\"margin:18px 0 0; padding:14px 16px; background:#fff8e6; border:1px solid #f3d58a; border-radius:8px; color:#594214; font-size:13px; line-height:1.55;\">\n                  <strong>Pourquoi cette offre ?</strong> Notre modele de fidelisation a detecte une baisse potentielle d engagement. Nous souhaitons vous offrir le meilleur service pour continuer a organiser des evenements exceptionnels avec EventZella.\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:12px 32px 30px;\">\n                <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:16px;\">\n                  <a href=\"mailto:larrymclarens@gmail.com\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#175cd3; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:6px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700;\">Contacter le support</a>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"background:#f8fafc; border-top:1px solid #d9e2ec; padding:16px 32px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#667085; text-align:center;\">Message automatique genere par le systeme de fidelisation EventZella. Si vous avez des questions, contactez notre equipe.</td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>",
